/* 城镇暗线剧本库 / 孤儿院·钟表铺·港区·图书馆·神殿 / 多阶段差分 */

:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestCellar or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	你推开走廊尽头虚掩的木门，一股混杂着陈年樟脑与潮湿石砖的气息扑面而来。借着走廊漏进来的微光，你注意到最里侧堆放杂物的木架与地面之间有一道半圆形的刮痕，似乎木架后方藏着一扇经常被人挪动的暗门。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:06)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCellar_stg_1")>><<if "mpQuestCellar" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 1>>
	你费力地将沉重的木架往旁推开半尺，露出一扇嵌在石墙里的老旧橡木窄门。门锁上积着薄灰，你在旁边的煤油灯底座下摸到了一小截断裂的黄铜钥匙齿痕。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:08)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 2>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 8>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCellar_stg_2")>><<if "mpQuestCellar" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 2>>
	顺着门缝往下是一段通往地下半层的石阶。你在石阶转角的壁龛里发现了一本被撕去数页的孤儿院早期收养登记册，残存的纸页边缘用暗红墨水写着高街钟表铺与三号干船坞的缩写。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你屏息仔细摸索。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:11)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 3>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 11>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCellar_stg_3")>><<if "mpQuestCellar" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 3>>
	继续向内探索时，头顶走廊传来了沉重的脚步声。你迅速闪身躲进储物室的旧衣柜后方屏住呼吸，透过木板缝隙看见一道黑影在暗门外停留了片刻才转身离去。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>>你手法干净利落。<<else>>你隔着衣袖操作。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:14)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 4>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 14>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCellar_stg_4")>><<if "mpQuestCellar" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 4>>
	待脚步声彻底消失，你撬开了地下暗室角落的一只铅封铁皮箱。箱内整整齐齐地码放着几封数十年前的匿名汇款单，收款人一栏全都被黑墨涂抹殆尽。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 500>>你迅速理清了脉络。<<else>>你默记下关键方位。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:16)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 5>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 16>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCellar_stg_5")>><<if "mpQuestCellar" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 5>>
	你将汇款单与早期收养登记册拼合比对，发现有一批孤儿院早年的院童档案被转移到了牛津街学园与圣堂地下修道院。真相的轮廓已在你手中逐渐清晰。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($pain or 0) gte 20>>你忍痛探入暗格。<<else>>你蹲身取出证物。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:19)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 6>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 19>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCellar_stg_6")>><<if "mpQuestCellar" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 6>>
	你把旧储物室的暗门恢复原状，将关键的账册残页与古物妥善贴身收好。这段尘封在孤儿院地底的往事已由你亲手揭开。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($exposed or 0) gte 1>>你借着阴影遮体。<<else>>你从容收好物证。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:22)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCellar to 1>><<pass 22>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCellar_stg_7")>><<if "mpQuestCellar" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg gte 7>>
	你已经将『孤儿院旧储物室暗门』的来龙去脉查探得一清二楚，这里熟悉的角落让你感到格外踏实。
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[抹去痕迹离开 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Resolve [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
你将从储物室暗门石阶下找到的缺页收养登记册夹进贴身内袋，顺手把堆放杂物的木架拉回原位盖住地面刮痕。
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>走廊外的查房脚步声早已远去，只剩下壁灯微弱的嗡鸣。<<else>>白昼孤儿院前厅传来扫地声，你趁无人注意闪身走出木门。<</if>>
登记册上的暗红缩写为你指明了下一步核查的方向。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[在原地复查细节 (0:03)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[带着收获返回 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

