:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<set _stg to ($mpQuestCatacomb or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	你走近神殿侧廊那座青铜烛台，蹲下身仔细观察底座与石板地面摩擦出的新鲜弧形刮痕。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($exposed or 0) gte 1>>你借着阴影遮体。<<else>>你从容收好物证。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:06)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCatacomb_stg_1")>><<if "mpQuestCatacomb" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 1>>
	趁着四周没有僧侣经过，你双手握住烛台底座向右侧缓缓拧动了半圈，石壁内侧立刻传来了铁链滑轮收紧的低沉声响。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:08)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 2>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 8>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCatacomb_stg_2")>><<if "mpQuestCatacomb" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 2>>
	侧壁的一块浮雕石板向内凹陷滑开，露出一段向下延伸的幽暗石阶，潮湿的冷风中带着淡淡的没药与古旧檀香。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:11)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 3>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 11>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCatacomb_stg_3")>><<if "mpQuestCatacomb" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 3>>
	你借着微弱的烛光走下石阶，看到两侧石壁上刻满了早期教团记录『雾月之蚀』的壁画。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你屏息仔细摸索。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:14)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 4>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 14>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCatacomb_stg_4")>><<if "mpQuestCatacomb" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 4>>
	在石阶尽头的祭台暗龛里，你发现了一只用红蜡封存的银质圣油瓶与半卷羊皮祝祷文。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>>你手法干净利落。<<else>>你隔着衣袖操作。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续深入查探 (0:16)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Resolve]]>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 5>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCatacomb to 1>><<pass 16>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCatacomb_stg_5")>><<if "mpQuestCatacomb" is "mpQuestSmuggler">><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 5>>
	羊皮卷上详细记载了通往圣堂地下古修道院的暗河渡口方位与避开地下水网的法门。
